sprites.preview.png
# pnpm mapgen's default output — a scratch render for eyeballing. The crops
# worth keeping are promoted into evidence/ by hand, like the .qa captures.
/mapgen-*.png
# Scratch space for review harnesses — throwaway capture scripts and the
# screenshots they produce. Findings get written up in the docs and the
# pictures worth keeping are promoted into evidence/ by hand.
/.qa/

# Review-loop agent scratch — working files, not artifacts.
# Evidence belongs in evidence/<round>/; prompts in .claude/review/.
.scratch-*/
shot2*.mjs
*-verify.mjs
px-*.mjs
crop-*.mjs
